[09:54:46 UTC] [INFO] {"id":47745,"date":"2020-10-15T19:03:08","date_gmt":"2020-10-15T13:33:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/websitedemos.net\/?post_type=astra-sites&#038;p=47745"},"modified":"2026-08-25T12:47:22","modified_gmt":"2026-08-25T07:17:22","slug":"online-programming-course","status":"publish","type":"astra-sites","link":"https:\/\/websitedemos.net\/astra-site\/online-programming-course\/","title":{"rendered":"Online Programming Course"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>The Online Programming Course template is ideal for schools, colleges, universities or online learning. It\u2019s a light design with bold colors that reassure visitors as soon as they arrive, ready for them to explore the rest of your website.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The template includes a very attractive homepage with course outline areas and a selection of course pages to add more detail. The template is fully compatible with most learning management systems and WooCommerce, so you\u2019re all set to offer courses for free or for money.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key features of the Online Programming Course template<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Light website template with strong colors for learning<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Compatible with learning management systems<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Compatible with WooCommerce for paid courses<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ideal for schools, colleges, universities or online learning<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Full compatibility with leading page builders<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Light online course website that welcomes you in and converts you easily<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":259,"featured_media":47750,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"inline_featured_image":false,"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility